title: SquidTalkTavern
tags: smallTalk
---
BabySquid: Dad, can we eat that fish...?
DaddySquid: *Sigh* No child, we can't eat the fish
MommySquid: What have they been hearing from those other children?!
BabySquid: Sharing is caring!
MommySquid: Well, I suppose those children are alright. What about the other ones?!
BabySquid: Uhhh... we're gross??
Daddy Squid: No... we suck. we're not gross... we suck
Mommy Squid: That's worse my love.
===
